      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1026410162448883
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "As the police has registered the FIR and the accused are even arrested, hence, application in hand under sec. 156(3) Cr.P.C. is disposed of leaving the applicant at liberty to avail efficacious remedy as and when report under section 173 Cr.p.c will be presented by the police.\"",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
