      "summary_sent_score": 0.15870486199855804
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "From the conjoint reading of the aforesaid report as well as the order it is evident that SHO reported to the Court with respect to pending FIR, however, the same was mistook by the concerned Court as the report on the application believing that FIR already stands registered.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3234,
      "end": 3511,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5871877074241638
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "In view of aforesaid circumstances, this Court does not find any reason to interfere in the impugned order dated 14.02.2023 wherein the trial Court held that so far as respondent No.1/accused No.4 is concerned there was no evidence that he ever intentionally gave a false report in the Court.",
